<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss bonds end weak session lower.</title>
<headline>Swiss bonds end weak session lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>1500 GMT - Swiss bonds were lower at the end of the session with the long end of the market suffering the heavier losses.</p>
<p>* September CONF was down 20 basis points to 121.00</p>
<p>* Avg yield on government bonds 3.16 pct (3.15 pct)</p>
